{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"zhanggu-p-chenxun-dianjun","name":"陈恂（吴典军）","evidence":["zhanggu-q-d95ac6b70220ae016119","zhanggu-q-d0dbbb7f5888a03c83db"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhanggu-m-e7dc493e06a200eef3c4","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及陈恂","evidence":["zhanggu-q-d95ac6b70220ae016119","zhanggu-q-d0dbbb7f5888a03c83db"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhanggu-q-d0dbbb7f5888a03c83db","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-6eb0af4c477f92dd3257","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《吴录》曰：“全琮父子屡言：‘芍陂之役，为典军陈恂诈增张休、顾承之功，而休、承与恂通情。’休坐系狱；权为谭故，沉吟不决，欲令谭谢而释之。及大会，以问谭；谭不谢，而曰：‘陛下，谗言其兴乎？’”","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":234,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0e9e6cb7871c9e632d55","start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d95ac6b70220ae016119","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-0ccf265f45e5a3e57842","layer":"original","quote":"为鲁王霸友党所谮，与顾谭、承俱以“芍陂论功事〖19〗，休、承与典军陈恂通情，诈增其伐〖20〗”，并徙交州","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
